 d2edcug0 hpfvmrgz rj1gh0hx buofh1pr g5gj957u o8rfisnq p8fzw8mz pcp91wgn iuny7tx3 ipjc6fyt\"><div class=\"j83agx80 cbu4d94t ew0dbk1b irj2b8pg\"><div class=\"qzhwtbm6 knvmm38d\"><div class=\"j83agx80 cbu4d94t ew0dbk1b irj2b8pg\"><div class=\"qzhwtbm6 knvmm38d\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\"><div dir=\"auto\">They also know the best options for Spring Breakers looking to enjoy the nightlife and for families looking for a relaxing and friendly getaway.  They been doing this a long time and are the experts in the industry.</div><div dir=\"auto\"> </div></div><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle\"><p>This Holiday Season, they are offering <strong>$100 OFF</strong> per person to any Irish Life Experience alumni and parents of students to help plan their dream vacation if booked by January 1st, 2022.  You will need to reference your booking code or confirmation of participation.  </p><p>What a wonderful offer to take advantage of with <a href=\"https://gobluetours.com/\">Go Blue Tours</a> during the Irish Life Experience Advent-ure. </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
